timeline
  title A family's two weeks with If I Disappear
  section Two weeks before
    Day -14 : Start the household (who leaves, when, for how long) : Voice notes about a normal month : Photos of the bills, the school notice, the clinic book
  section The week before
    Day -10 : Check the facts, each with its quote : See what stops, on which date, and why
    Day -7 : Read what nobody said : Try what-ifs : Get the plan for the time left
  section The last days
    Day -5 to -1 : Ask, share contacts, leave documents, register a second number : Practise by voice or typing : Print the card and send each person a private link
  section The absence
    Day 0 : Leave; the Continuity Card is on the fridge : The person staying has their part on their phone
    Planned next : Reminders on the person staying's own phone : A short practice before a rare task comes due
